{"id":"en_surrounded-by-wolves","title":"Surrounded by Wolves","titleEn":"Surrounded by Wolves","description":"Bella believed her marriage was flawless—until she discovered that her husband Wilder and his brother Cross had used an astrolabe to stage a fake soul swap. Their aim was to ruin her reputation through a manufactured scandal and take her fortune. Bella played along outwardly while secretly turning the tables: she outmaneuvered both men, took control of their assets, and brought their plot into the open. Along the way, she found genuine love with the real Cross and began a new life.","poster":"https://cdn1.nsstorage.space/surrounded-by-wolves/en_US/a07426ca32bd65ac/cover.webp","backdrop":"https://cdn1.nsstorage.space/surrounded-by-wolves/en_US/a07426ca32bd65ac/cover.webp","kind":"series","year":2025,"genres":["Chinese Fantasy","Counterattack","Scumbag-punishing","Short Drama"],"featured":false,"sources":[{"id":"rumble-0","label":"Rumble HD (Ad-Free)","url":"https://rumble.com/embed/v7devq8/?pub=4occak","kind":"embed","downloadable":false}],"episodes":[{"id":"ep_surrounded-by-wolves_1","title":"Episode 1","season":1,"number":1,"sources":[{"id":"rumble-0","label":"Rumble HD (Ad-Free)","url":"https://rumble.com/embed/v7devq8/?pub=4occak","kind":"embed","downloadable":false}]},{"id":"ep_surrounded-by-wolves_2","title":"Episode 2","season":1,"number":2,"sources":[{"id":"rumble-0","label":"Rumble HD (Ad-Free)","url":"https://rumble.com/embed/v7devq8/?pub=4occak","kind":"embed","downloadable":false}]},{"id":"ep_surrounded-by-wolves_3","title":"Episode 3","season":1,"number":3,"sources":[{"id":"rumble-0","label":"Rumble HD (Ad-Free)","url":"https://rumble.com/embed/v7devq8/?pub=4occak","kind":"embed","downloadable":false}]},{"id":"ep_surrounded-by-wolves_4","title":"Episode 4","season":1,"number":4,"sources":[{"id":"rumble-0","label":"Rumble HD (Ad-Free)","url":"https://rumble.com/embed/v7devq8/?pub=4occak","kind":"embed","downloadable":false}]},{"id":"ep_surrounded